thought_1 = It's important to recognize the unique strengths that both genders can bring to society. Neither should be confined to certain roles due to societal expectations;
thought_2 = While biology plays a role in some physiological differences, these shouldn't be allowed to dictate one’s capabilities or societal contributions;
thought_3 = Empathy and emotional intelligence might be seen as particularly feminine traits, yet they're invaluable in leadership and can exist in both genders.
